# Basic case arm: [case [let n@Int] body] inside a match expression.
# Exercises typecheck_case_arm with a typed binding — n gets type scrutinee_ty ∩ Int.
# With scrutinee 42 (Int), n is bound to 42, and [+ n 1] evaluates to 43.
[match 42
  [case [let n@Int] [+ n 1]]
  [case [let _] 0]]
=== out
Int(43)
